-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party code
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

FibGo/internal/bigfft contains code derived from bigfft by Rémy Oudompheng
(https://github.com/remyoudompheng/bigfft) and from the Go standard library's
math/big, both under the BSD-3-Clause license. The upstream portions remain
under that license. The derived files, the upstream revision and the license
text are listed in FibGo/NOTICE; the upstream notice is kept verbatim in
FibGo/internal/bigfft/LICENSE.

FibPolyglotte/contracts/b000045.txt is generated by Binet's formula and checked
against the definition of the sequence; it is not copied from the OEIS. It
matches OEIS sequence A000045 (https://oeis.org/A000045), the public reference.
